WEBVTT

00:01:56.266 --> 00:02:01.010
And he hand-selected a team
of local Aboriginal people

00:02:01.034 --> 00:02:02.667
to work on this project.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.245
Yami told us at that first meeting,

00:02:05.269 --> 00:02:09.011
"There's no money," --
always a good start --

00:02:09.035 --> 00:02:12.524
" ... no money, you have six months,

00:02:12.548 --> 00:02:15.562
and I want you to start on a project --"
which, in his language,

00:02:15.586 --> 00:02:18.314
he called "Uwankara Palyanku Kanyintjaku,"

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:23.300
which, translated, is "a plan
to stop people getting sick" --

00:02:23.324 --> 00:02:24.737
a profound brief.

00:02:27.265 --> 00:02:28.827
That was our task.